-     ACL is used to determine which operations a user is permitted to
-     perform on that object.  See section 3.5.</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-1.5-2">attribute
-     A named value within an entry.  See section 3.1.</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-1.5-3">comparator
-     A named function which can be used to perform one or more of
-     three comparison operations: ordering, equality and substring
-     matching.  See section 3.4.</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-1.5-4">context
